   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Class:</strong> PQ Shotgun<br>\n<strong>Range:</strong> Long Barrel Shotgun</p>\n<p>No Aimed Shots. Fires fuel canisters (50eb (Costly) each) that act as Armor-Piercing slugs, can't cause Critical Injuries, and set a damaged target Deadly on Fire (6 HP per Turn). On a Critical Failure it doesn't jam; instead it vents flame and sets the user Mildly on Fire (2 HP per Turn).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Its range tables come from this module's DV Tables compendium; run the module's \"Use Corgo's 77 DV Tables\" macro once per world (see the module README).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Weapon Catalog).</em></p>"
